The files in this directory (train.jsonl, dev.jsonl, test.jsonl) are a database, not part of
the MIT-licensed software in this repository.

Contents
--------
600 labeled US address examples: the first 400 train, 100 dev and 100 test examples of a build of
this repository's data pipeline. Each example records its upstream source in its `source` field:

- osm, ways, places: OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors.
- openaddresses: OpenAddresses data (https://openaddresses.io) from the government sources listed
  at https://github.com/openaddresses/openaddresses/tree/06015e09e15bbcfdaac7d10883665db66c4d1f1c/sources/us,
  including Oregon Metro (ODbL 1.0).
- embedded: one of the above wrapped in synthetic text.
- junk: synthetic text only (src/data/not-address.ts).

All upstream lines come from libpostal's parser training data, snapshot 20170304
(https://github.com/openvenues/libpostal; files listed in src/data/libpostal.ts).

