Method of making it (ODbL 4.6)
------------------------------
From a checkout of https://github.com/NickCrews/addrparse at the commit that last changed these
files:

    pnpm install
    pnpm data:fetch            # src/data/fetch.ts: downloads the libpostal snapshot's US lines
    pnpm data:build            # src/data/build.ts: refines labels and splits into data/
    node src/data/fixture.ts   # copies the first examples of each split here

Every step is deterministic, so this reproduces the files byte for byte.
